COMPILATION OF: E46N11

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N11

   1 a 0000 E46N11:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] RUNTIME: BARE SKIP BETWEEN TWO ITEMS,
   4 a 0006      as three statements.  Control E46N16 writes the same
   5 a 0006      two items with NO skip. */
   6 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   7 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N11OUT DAT');
   8 c 0023   put file(outf) list('A');
   9 c 003D   put file(outf) skip;
  10 c 0051   put file(outf) list('B');
  11 c 006B   close file(outf);
  12 c 0071   stop;
  13 a 0074 end E46N11;

CODE SIZE = 0074
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3884
END  COMPILATION
